   "stance": "silent",
   "note": "Mann: 'tl- (1) ... lift, raise, bear, suffer'. WP I, 701 & 738-9' with Tocharian, Greek tlēmi, Latin tuli, Gothic þulan — Sanskrit tulā is not quoted under this head."
  }
 ]
